        "created_at": "2013-05-10T15:55:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Return with the Dawn. Ongoing. \"At the end fo the villain turn, shuffle the villain trash and reveal cards from the top until a citizen is revealed. put it into play. Put the other revealed cards back into the villain trash.\" That came out on the villain play a card phase and activated at the end of the villain turn to bring Citizen Sweat into play. It also shuffled Citizen Dawn's discard into her deck, thus resetting the countdown to her flip.</p>",
