        "created_at": "2013-05-10T16:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>But Citizen Sweat wasn't in your original line up so what was she doing in the trash for Return to bring her back from?</p><p>Also why did you shuffle the trash back into the deck given none of Dawn's cards require that. I think you might have misread how Return works. It says shuffle the trash not shuffle the trash into the deck. You just randomise the cards in the trash and pull a Citizen out and put them back into play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
